  "overview": "Zendesk Garden — the design system behind Zendesk products.",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Dark (#070d0d) canvas paired with `#070d0d` component surfaces and `#f7f7f8` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#2694d6` with `#000000` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `-apple-system` across 8 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
